    "title": {
      "en": "Profession Quality of Life Improvements in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Mejoras en la calidad de vida profesional en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Profession Quality of Life Improvements in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Mejoras en la calidad de vida profesional en WoW: para siempre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab69026b64471.93782081\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">World of Warcraft: Forever includes some nice quality-of-life changes for professions!<h2 id=\"track-recipe\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Track Recipe</span></h2>One large quality-of-life improvement in WoW: Forever is the ability to track your recipes. When you open your profession pane, you'll see a new checkbox at the bottom near \"Create All\".<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303155.png\" id=\"1303155\"><img width=\"600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303155.png?maxWidth=600\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Professions Window\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.13389 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Clicking this checkbox will allow you to track the required materials on the right side of the screen, similar to a quest. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303156.jpg\" id=\"1303156\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303156.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Track Materials\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.972299 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>This can help you remember the recipe and the required reagents when you're buying things from the Auction House or farming materials in the Open World!<h2 id=\"chat-linking\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Chat Linking</span></h2>In WoW: Forever, players can link their entire profession book to other players! When you open your profession, there is a small chat bubble to the right of your skill bar. Clicking the chat bubble brings up a menu that links your Profession book in a chat channel of your choice. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303157.png\" id=\"1303157\"><img width=\"600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303157.png?maxWidth=600\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Profession Linking in Chat\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.16923 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Other players can click this link to see your profession skill and available recipes!<h2 id=\"filters\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Filters</span></h2>New Filters are also available to sort through all your recipes. There are <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/over-600-new-recipes-in-wow-forever-382864\" data-contiguous=\"true\">over 600 new recipes</a> in WoW: Forever, and new filters can help you search through your profession list:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Has skill up</b> - If you're looking to level up your profession only, this is a great filter to see the available options.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Have materials</b> - If you're looking to see only what you can craft.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Slots</b> - If you're looking for a specific gear slot, such as trinkets or created items.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Search Bar</b> - If you know the name of what you're looking for, find it directly.</div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303157.png\" id=\"1303157\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303157.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Filters\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.16923 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>World of Warcraft: Forever includes some nice quality-of-life changes for professions!<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Track Recipe</h2><br /><br />One large quality-of-life improvement in WoW: Forever is the ability to track your recipes. When you open your profession pane, you'll see a new checkbox at the bottom near &quot;Create All&quot;.<br /><br />Clicking this checkbox will allow you to track the required materials on the right side of the screen, similar to a quest. <br /><br />This can help you remember the recipe and the required reagents when you're buying things from the Auction House or farming materials in the Open World!<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Chat Linking</h2><br /><br />In WoW: Forever, players can link their entire profession book to other players! When you open your profession, there is a small chat bubble to the right of your skill bar. Clicking the chat bubble brings up a menu that links your Profession book in a chat channel of your choice. <br /><br />Other players can click this link to see your profession skill and available recipes!<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Filters</h2><br /><br />New Filters are also available to sort through all your recipes. There are <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/over-600-new-recipes-in-wow-forever-382864\">over 600 new recipes</a> in WoW: Forever, and new filters can help you search through your profession list:<br /><ul><li><b>Has skill up</b> - If you're looking to level up your profession only, this is a great filter to see the available options.</li><li><b>Have materials</b> - If you're looking to see only what you can craft.</li><li><b>Slots</b> - If you're looking for a specific gear slot, such as trinkets or created items.</li><li><b>Search Bar</b> - If you know the name of what you're looking for, find it directly.</li></ul><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
